title: Review and ratify recent Sovnarkom decrees. 
subtitle: The CEC may add its stamp of approval to laws created by Sovnarkom. 
new-page: true
tags: cec
on-arrival: {!
  Q.democraticity += 3; Q.instability -= 1;
  Q.cec_incident = 0;
  if (Q.b_soviet_display <= 50) { Q.cec_incident += 1; }
  if (
      ((Q.left_m_relation <= 60 || Q.m_relation <= 55 || Q.right_m_relation <= 50) &&  Q.m_soviet_display > 0) ||
      ((Q.centre_sr_relation <= 55 || Q.right_sr_relation <= 50) && Q.sr_soviet_display > 0) ||
      (Q.lsr_relation <= 65 && Q.lsr_soviet_display > 0)
    )  { Q.cec_incident += 1; }
!}

= Legislation Review

Both the CEC and Sovnarkom have the ability to pass laws in their own right, but it's nonetheless prudent to have both bodies give their approval to key legislation. A number of recent pieces of legislation are discussed by the CEC and approved without incident. 

[?if cec_incident > 0 : On the other hand, the opposition parties take this opportunity to attack a number of recent decrees, causing embarrassment for the government. ?]

- @separation_of_powers
- @amend
- @reject
- @great



@separation_of_powers
title: The opposition is demanding a discussion on the separation of powers...
view-if: sovnarkom_powers_vote != 1
go-to: sovnarkom_powers

@amend
title: Amend some laws, cancel a few we no longer need. 
view-if: sovnarkom_powers_vote = 1 and cec_incident > 0
on-arrival: {!
  Q.left_m_relation += 2; Q.m_relation += 2; Q.right_m_relation += 2; Q.sdi_relation += 2; Q.lsr_relation += 2; Q.centre_sr_relation += 2; Q.right_sr_relation += 2; Q.ns_relation += 2;
  Q.left_m_strength += 2; Q.lsr_strength += 2; 
  Q.democraticity += 1; Q.instability -= 0.5; 
  Q.moderate_unrest -= 5; Q.leninist_unrest += 5; 
  Q.moderate_strength += 2;
!}

@reject
title: Instruct the party fraction to ignore the opposition.
choose-if: b_soviet_display > 50
view-if: sovnarkom_powers_vote = 1 and cec_incident > 0
unavailable-subtitle: The opposition has the votes to force through amendments. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.left_m_relation -= 2; Q.m_relation -= 2; Q.right_m_relation -= 2; Q.sdi_relation -= 2; Q.lsr_relation -= 2; Q.centre_sr_relation -= 2; Q.right_sr_relation -= 2; Q.ns_relation -= 2;
  Q.left_m_strength -= 2; Q.lsr_strength -= 2; 
  Q.democraticity -= 1; Q.instability += 0.5; 
  Q.moderate_unrest += 5; Q.leninist_unrest -= 5; 
  Q.moderate_strength -= 2;
!}

@great
title: Great work everyone! 
choose-if: b_soviet_display > 50
view-if: sovnarkom_powers_vote = 1 and cec_incident = 0
go-to: root
